        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>Dear 2015 Challengers, Friends of the Challenge and Community Foundation Donors,</p>
<p>Congratulations! Together, we’ve accomplished yet another Tin Cup Challenge, directly benefitting Teton Valley nonprofits and our entire community. The results of the 2015 Tin Cup Challenge giving campaign are still being tallied, but all signs point to this being another highly successful year.</p>
<p>I’d like to extend a personal thank you to each and every one of you for believing in the power of <strong><em>your</em></strong> <strong><em>generosity</em></strong> to improve lives in Teton Valley. The effects of this belief are in full force in our community, as evidenced by the incredible work our nonprofits are engaged in, thanks to the funding they receive year after year from the Tin Cup Challenge and donors, like you.</p>
<p>As you know, gifts to the Challenger Fund are the key component to the success of the Tin Cup Challenge, providing the matching funds that inspire others to give to their favorite local nonprofits, and give more generously. We are deeply grateful for your continued support, both of the Tin Cup Challenger Fund and the Community Foundation of Teton Valley, and the powerful positive impact you have in our community.</p>
<p>With Gratitude,</p>
<p>Carrie Mowrey<br />
Executive Director</p>
